{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1423439001:1":{"text":"どうしたんですか？何か手伝えることはありますか？","source_cn":"小姑娘，我们有什么能帮到你的地方吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D06636FBDDD9334","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423439002:1":{"text":"ミーちゃんちゃんがいないの……どこにも、いないの！","source_cn":"我的咪咪不见了……咪咪找不到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA6FB4FBA5B37D55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423439003:1":{"text":"ママとパパの代わりに、そばにいてくれると思ったのに……ミーちゃんまで、あたしをおいてっちゃうの……？","source_cn":"我以为咪咪会代替爸爸妈妈陪着我的，咪咪，连你也不要我了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85DEC0184F3255E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423439004:1":{"text":"この子、親をなくしたのでしょうか？「ミーちゃん」というペットだけが家族だったのかも……","source_cn":"听上去这个小女孩失去了自己的家人，和一只叫“咪咪”的宠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19480A298D8223D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423439005:1":{"text":"ミーちゃんちゃんというのは、どんな子なんですか？","source_cn":"小姑娘，你的咪咪长什么样子呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8312852939DF56BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title